cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "convgap: measuring the conversion of statistical significance into forecasting value"
message: "If you use this software or its exhibits, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Divyansh
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research code for a study measuring how often, and by how much, statistically
  significant predictors in financial modelling convert into forecasting or
  decision value. Every reported number is bound to the artifact that produced
  it and to a digest of that artifact, so an exhibit can state which of its
  entries have been traced to a live computation and which have not.
keywords:
  - forecast evaluation
  - backtesting
  - model validation
  - empirical finance
